# Cashlight project

- Turborepo: `apps/web` (Next.js 14), `packages/db` (Supabase)
- Package manager: **pnpm** only
- Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/Prompt_1_Landing_page.md` before implementing features
- Strict TypeScript — no `any`, enable `noUncheckedIndexedAccess` patterns
- Run `pnpm typecheck` after substantive changes

## File placement

- Marketing UI: `apps/web/app/(marketing)/` and `apps/web/components/marketing/`
- Shared DB logic: `packages/db` — never query Supabase directly from components
- API routes: thin handlers; business logic in `packages/db`

## Do not

- Add shadcn, MUI, Chakra, or other UI kits unless explicitly requested
- Use purple/blue fintech gradients or generic "dashboard" copy
- Put `SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY` in client code or `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` (publishable key only on the client)
